From c21490e83c936d845b39b99dc9755e624b8808d0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rolando Trevino <rolotrealanis@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 06:28:35 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 07/10] dt-bindings: arm: apple: apple,pmgr: Add t6050
 compatible

The T6050 (M5 Pro/Max) PMGR blocks are described as "apple,t6050-pmgr",
"apple,t8103-pmgr", "syscon", "simple-mfd" in the T6050 device trees,
like the other SoCs after T6000. Add the per-SoC compatible.

Signed-off-by: Rolando Trevino <rolotrealanis@gmail.com>
Assisted-by: LLM Claude
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/apple/apple,pmgr.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/apple/apple,pmgr.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/apple/apple,pmgr.yaml
index 5d9f55c3e589..91ae5a3ce1bc 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/apple/apple,pmgr.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/apple/apple,pmgr.yaml
@@ -41,6 +41,7 @@ properties:
               - apple,t6030-pmgr
               - apple,t6031-pmgr
               - apple,t6041-pmgr
+              - apple,t6050-pmgr
               - apple,t8122-pmgr
               - apple,t8132-pmgr
               - apple,t8140-pmgr
-- 
